      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STOMP ROCKER (1) finished a one length third last start over 300m at Murray Bridge in a strong 16.68. Should be in this for a long way. ZIPPING WICHITA (2) was well fancied last time on the strength of the win two back but could only manage second (31.08) at this track. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Winning chance. AILEEN'S SHINE (3) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (31.13) at this track in a Grade 6. Lines up from box 3 for the first time. Has a good record here including five wins. The form from his last run stacks up well. Well-placed to take this out. BILLY BUST UP (8) cannot be left out after leading and holding on for a placing last start.",
